# ============================================================
# Sparrow .gitignore
# 原则：只提交「人写的东西」和「构建必需的配置」，
#       其余（产物、缓存、本地设置、密钥、大资源）一律不进仓库。
# ============================================================

# ===== .NET 构建产物 =====
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
[Pp]ublish/
artifacts/
x64/
x86/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.deps.json
*.runtimeconfig.json
*.FileListAbsolute.txt
*.assets.cache
*.AssemblyReference.cache
*.CoreCompileInputs.cache
*.genruntimeconfig.cache

# ===== NuGet =====
packages/
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
*.nuget.dgspec.json
project.assets.json
project.nuget.cache

# ===== IDE / 编辑器 =====
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
.fleet/
.history/
_ReSharper*/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.userprefs
*.sln.docstates
*.DotSettings.user
*.swp
*~
*.orig
*.rej

# Visual Studio 本地缓存 / 性能会话
*.VC.db
*.VC.VC.opendb
*.psess
*.vsp
*.vspx
*.sap

# ===== 测试与覆盖率 =====
TestResults/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
coverage/
coverage-report/

# ===== 日志与临时文件 =====
*.log
logs/
*.tmp
*.bak

# ===== 本地工具索引 =====
.codegraph/
.dotnet/

# ===== 本地设置（含机器相关路径）=====
**/Properties/launchSettings.json

# ===== 敏感文件（绝不提交）=====
*.snk
*.pfx
*.p12
secrets.json
appsettings.*.local.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ===== 大体积模型 / 二进制资源 =====
# OCR 模型走下载或独立安装包，不进仓库（见 docs/plugin-model.md）
*.onnx
*.ort
*.pdmodel
*.pdiparams
*.pdopt

# ===== 操作系统 =====
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
